{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Change your perspective, and the world transforms.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Dimension Ascent&quot;</strong> is a puzzle-action platformer that utilizes perspective shifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change the way you see the world and take on unique puzzles and challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd39 Key Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Perspective Rotation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/\uc2dc\uc810\ud68c\uc804.gif?t=1744248624\" /><br>Rotate the map to create new paths and discover hidden routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Perspective Shift</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/\uc2dc\uc810\uc804\ud658.gif?t=1744248624\" /><br>View the world from the eyes of another entity to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Perspective Projection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/\uc2dc\uc810\ud22c\uc601.gif?t=1744248624\" /><br>Explore the world in a unique way, seamlessly transitioning between 2D and 3D.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620080?t=1744248624","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620080?t=1744248624","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/31c2f120d33b9b9f05ffd7d163d038a2a4a9760f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744248624","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/31c